  "content": "\n\n<h1>背包扩容 - yyz的背包模组</h1>\n<p><strong>背包直接集成</strong><br>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7c7ebd872683a4f5860d80ac023b9a0674a9c4f9.gif\" alt=\"show\" width=\"385\" height=\"223\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1d862f817680bcf1cbec51827a8020691d9c7c97.gif\" alt=\"craft\" width=\"390\" height=\"226\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2d03ad242b88889756076fae21bd2e2871698735.gif\" alt=\"save\" width=\"390\" height=\"226\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/011b793aa53f969f2ec6d5257f7603bc56789ca1.gif\" alt=\"pick\" width=\"390\" height=\"226\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/05c7b41411b7a40589213223687065285ee8da74.png\" alt=\"model\" width=\"784\" height=\"458\"> &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🌟 模组亮点</h2>\n<h3>⚡ 无缝GUI集成</h3>\n<p>背包栏位直接显示在<strong>工作GUI</strong>（物品栏/工作台/箱子等）中，无需打开额外的界面。</p>\n<h3>🛠️ 增强功能</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>🖱️ <strong>物品转移</strong><br>Shift+左键单击 → 转移至主物品栏 &nbsp;<br>Shift+右键单击 → 转移至背包物品栏<br>双击 → 自动整理物品 &nbsp;</li>\n<li>📦 <strong>物品收集</strong><br>物品栏满时自动将物品存入背包<br>死亡时背包掉落为单个物品（内容物保留）</li>\n<li>🔥<strong>JEI/REI/EMI 集成</strong><br>支持在<strong>JEI/REI/EMI合成界面中直接使用背包物品</strong><br>配方界面实时显示背包内容</li>\n<li>💍 <strong>饰品槽支持</strong><br>背包可放置于<strong>Curios/Trinkets 饰品槽</strong>中</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🎒 背包等级</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>背包类型</th>\n<th>额外栏位</th>\n<th>特殊能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>木质</td>\n<td>+9</td>\n<td>基础容量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>石质</td>\n<td>+18</td>\n<td>基础容量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铁质</td>\n<td>+27</td>\n<td>基础容量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金质</td>\n<td>+36</td>\n<td>基础容量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钻石质</td>\n<td>+45</td>\n<td>基础容量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>下界合金</strong></td>\n<td><strong>+54</strong></td>\n<td><strong>火焰免疫</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>⚙️ 兼容性</h2>\n<p>如果看不清，请访问： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fyyzs-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/yyzs-backpack</a></p>\n<h3>状态图例</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>✅ <strong>完全兼容</strong></li>\n<li>⚠️ <strong>部分支持</strong></li>\n<li>⌛ <strong>计划中</strong></li>\n<li>❌ <strong>不支持</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>功能支持状态</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>&nbsp;</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>1.21.6</th>\n<th>1.21.5</th>\n<th>1.21.4</th>\n<th>1.21.2-1.21.3</th>\n<th>1.21.1</th>\n<th>1.20.5-1.20.6</th>\n<th>1.20.2-1.20.4</th>\n<th>1.20.1</th>\n<th>1.19.4</th>\n<th>1.19.3</th>\n<th>1.19-1.19.2</th>\n<th>1.18-1.18.2</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>JEI</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Curios</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Trinkets</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Quark</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Accessories</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>REI</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EMI</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Inventorio</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IPN</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物品栏整理</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3D模型</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Doggy Talents Next</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AE2</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>❓ 为什么选择这个背包？</h2>\n<p>传统背包模组 = 需要单独GUI的移动箱子。我们的解决方案：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>无缝体验</strong> - 直接在<strong>工作GUI</strong>中访问背包物品</li>\n<li><strong>原生交互</strong> - 完整支持配方书/<strong>JEI/REI/EMI</strong></li>\n<li><strong>背包切换</strong> - 将背包放入背包槽/内部时自动切换</li>\n<li><strong>持续扩展</strong> - 不断增长的模组兼容性支持</li>\n</ol>\n<p>未定义</p>\n<h2>⚠️ 当前状态</h2>\n<p><strong>该模组目前处于非常早期的开发阶段。如果您发现任何错误，可以通过 GitHub 或 Discord 进行反馈</strong><br>❗ 发现问题或有建议？ </p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/yyz729/yyzsbackpack/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f3NPKBgXxVU\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>🔧 <strong>正在开发中</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>更多GUI支持</li>\n<li>背包3D模型</li>\n<li>扩展的模组兼容性</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>✨ <strong>设计理念</strong>：让背包成为主物品栏的自然延伸</p>\n</blockquote>",
